This project is a modernized reimplementation of the "displaycameras" project
by Anonymousdog:

    https://github.com/Anonymousdog/displaycameras

which is also licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

It reuses that project's configuration-file format and command-line interface,
and is otherwise substantially rewritten to run on current Raspberry Pi OS
(Bookworm/Trixie): it replaces omxplayer + dispmanx + fbi + D-Bus with mpv on
the KMS/DRM graphics stack, adds a low-power ("lite") single-camera backend for
ARMv6 boards, and adds dual-HDMI support. These are significant changes from
the original work.
